      "title": "COPART (CPRT) INVESTIGATION ALERT: Bragar Eagel & Squire, P.C. is Investigating Copart, Inc. on Behalf of Copart Stockholders and Encourages Investors to Contact the Firm",
      "summary": "Law firm Bragar Eagel & Squire is investigating Copart, Inc. following the announcement that CEO Jeff Liaw will step down effective July 31, 2026. The news triggered an 8.02% stock price decline ($2.45 per share) on June 29, 2026. The firm is seeking stockholders who suffered losses to discuss potential securities law violations and unlawful business practices.",
